
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Instagram Footer</title>

<style>
.footer {
    background-color: #fafafa;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 35px 20px;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    border-top: 1px solid #ddd;
}

.footer h2 {
    font-family: cursive;
    font-size: 30px;
    color: #262626;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.footer-links {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.footer a {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: #737373;
    font-size: 13px;
}

.footer a:hover {
    color: #0095f6;
}

.social-icons {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.footer p {
    color: #737373;
    font-size: 12px;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<footer class="footer">

    <h2>Instagram</h2>

    <div class="footer-links">
        <a href="#">About</a>
        <a href="#">Blog</a>
        <a href="#">Jobs</a>
        <a href="#">Help</a>
        <a href="#">API</a>
        <a href="#">Privacy</a>
        <a href="#">Terms</a>
    </div>

    <div class="social-icons">
        <a href="https://www.instagram.com/">Instagram</a>
        <a href="https://www.facebook.com/">Facebook</a>
        <a href="https://www.youtube.com/">YouTube</a>
    </div>

    <p>English | © 2026 Instagram</p>

</footer>

</body>
</html>
